-**Algorithm Steps:**
+**Steps:**
 
-1.  **Preprocessing:**
-    *   Extract nD voxel signatures from volume data based on user-selected attributes [S1].
-    *   Normalize the signatures [S1].
-
-2.  **Background Removal (Optional):**
-    *   Identify background voxels (e.g., air) in exterior regions [S1].
